hief Financial Officer of the Company have certified that the above financial results do not contain any false or misleading statements or figures and do not omit any material fact which may make the statements or figures contained therein misleading.   5.The Shareholders of the Company vide a special resolution passed in the Extraordinary General Meeting held on 23.12.2023, approved the issuance of 13,00,000 Equity shares of Rs. 10 each fully paid up on a preferential basis at an issue price of Rs. 326 each including a premium of Rs. 316/- per share. Further, the Company has received in-principle approval for issuance of 12,90,000 Equity shares of Rs. 10 each on Preferential Basis from both the Stock Exchanges on January 17, 2024. The Board of Directors in their meeting held on 31.01.2024 have allotted 12,90,000 Equity shares of Rs. 10 each fully paid up on a preferential basis at an issue price of Rs. 326 each including a premium of Rs. 316/- per share .   6. The company is primarily engaged in business of manufacturing of wheat & wheat products and accordingly there is no separate reportable segment under Ind AS 108.   7. Figures pertaining to previous year/periods have been regrouped/rearranged, reclassified and restated wherever necessary to make them comparable with those of current year/period.   8. The Unaudited Standalone Financial Results for the Quarter and Nine Months ended December 31, 2023 are available on the website of BSE Limited at http://www.bseindia.com, National Stock Exchange of India Limited at https://www.nseindia.com and on the website of the Company at https://www.megastarfoods.com", "re_desc_note_seg": "-", "re_dil_eps_bfr_exi": null, "re_dilut_eps_for_cont_dic_opr": "1.33", "re_diluted_eps": null, "re_excepn_items": null, "re_excepn_items_new": "0", "re_extraord_items": null, "re_face_val": "10", "re_face_value_debt": null, "re_from_dt": "01-OCT-2023", "re_goi_per_shhd": null, "re_grs_npa": null, "re_grs_npa_per": null, "re_inc_dre_sttr":